*> ********************************************************
*> PROGRAM : FEE0013
*> PURPOSE : FEE EXEMPTIONS RULES
*> AUTHOR  : J.K.
*> CHANGE LOG:
*>   1992-02-14 ORIGINAL VERSION
*>   2003-12-02 THRESHOLDS UPDATED PER AUDIT REQ 420
*> RUN FROM JCL JOB FEENIGHT STEP030
*> ********************************************************
IDENTIFICATION DIVISION.
PROGRAM-ID. FEE0013.
ENVIRONMENT DIVISION.
CONFIGURATION SECTION.
SOURCE-COMPUTER. IBM-370.
DATA DIVISION.
WORKING-STORAGE SECTION.
01 INPUT-AREA.
    *> ACCOUNT TYPE S=SAVINGS C=CHECKING P=PREMIUM G=GOLD B=BUSINESS F=FIXED
    05 WS-ATYP            PIC X.
    *> AVERAGE MONTHLY BALANCE
    05 M-BL               PIC 9(7)V99.
01 WS-RESULTS.
    05 FW-IND             PIC X VALUE 'N'.
    *> MONTHLY SERVICE FEE
    05 WS-MFEE            PIC 9(3)V99 VALUE ZERO.
PROCEDURE DIVISION.
0000-MAIN.
    ACCEPT INPUT-AREA
    PERFORM 2000-FEE-WAIVER
    DISPLAY "FW-IND=" FW-IND
    DISPLAY "WS-MFEE=" WS-MFEE
    STOP RUN.
2000-FEE-WAIVER.
    *> MONTHLY FEE WAIVER
    IF WS-ATYP = 'G'
       OR 'P'
       OR M-BL >= 2500
        MOVE 'Y' TO FW-IND
        MOVE 0 TO WS-MFEE
    ELSE
        MOVE 10 TO WS-MFEE
    END-IF.
